# Docs & Agent Handoff

## When to edit AGENTS.md
- New architectural invariant (auth model, package layout, "we use X not Y").
- A decision that future sessions must not rediscover.
- Do **not** dump ephemeral TODO lists into AGENTS.md — use issues/TODO.md.

## Handoff format (multi-session work)
At end of a substantial task, leave in PR or `TODO.md`:
1. Done
2. Not done / blocked
3. Exact next command or file to open
4. Assumptions made

## Language
- Match the user's language for chat; keep rule/code identifiers in English when that is the codebase norm.
